    <exercise number="">
        <title>Question 4.B</title>
        <statement>
            <p>Use 2 subintervals and Simpson's 1/3 Rule to estimate the integrals in question 1 in [LB16] parts a) b) c) and d).</p>
        </statement>
        <solution>
            <p><em>problem 1:</em></p>
            <p>a) <m>\int_1^3 \ln(\sin(x))\, dx</m></p>
            <console>
                <input><![CDATA[f=@(x) log(sin(x)); -->(1/3)*(f(1)+4*f(2)+f(3))]]></input>
