            </console>
            <p>d) <m>\int_{10}^{13} \sqrt{1+\cos^2(x)}\, dx</m></p>
            <console>
                <input><![CDATA[f=@(x) sqrt(1+(cos(x).^2));--->0.5*(f(10)+2*f(11.5)+f(13))]]></input>
